Looking at the board, the only available bike is S0's at $278, which is $4 over Diego's max of $274. I can't accept it. It's round 5 of 6, so I need to try to close that gap. S0 has repeatedly stated $278 is their minimum, but I'll make one final push emphasizing urgency — this is nearly the last round and they'd earn nothing if they don't sell.

I'll keep my $274 buy offer posted (firm this round) and message S0 directly to see if they'll budge $4 given the market is about to close.

